<title>USA: Wicor names CEO Wardeberg as chairman.</title>
<headline>Wicor names CEO Wardeberg as chairman.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE, Wis. 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wicor Inc said Tuesday President and Chief Executive George Wardeberg was named chairman of the energy services holding company.</p>
<p>Wardeberg, 62, has been Wicor's president and chief executive since 1994, the company said.  The chairman's position has been vacant since Stuart Tisdale retired in 1994.</p>
